Package: gnome-text-editor
Version: @DEB_GNOME-TEXT-EDITOR_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-text-editor
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0, libgtksourceview-5-0, libeditorconfig0, libenchant-2-2
Description: Simple GTK4 text editor for GNOME
 GNOME Text Editor is the default GTK4/libadwaita editor that replaced gedit.
 Runs as a plain X11 client under any window manager.
